blem).\nB. 08 Benny visual accuracy.\nC. 08 camera/view obstruction and phone-test follow-up.\nD. Screen 07 matching.\nE. Screen 06 matching.\nF. Screen 05 matching (line B artwork; important old branch context).\nG. Screen 04 matching.\n\nThe prior accounts exhausted usage quickly. AT MOST TWO active specialist cloud sessions simultaneously, possibly fewer if the account is near its limit. Avoid expensive repeated renders, duplicate sessions, and launching helpers merely to say \"parallel\". Assign strict file ownership, isolate branches, and have every agent complete ONE significant milestone, save, report, and STOP. The lead can run necessary read-only coordination and tests; do not allow shared-file edits to overlap without coordination.\n\nThe newest saved handoff reported no sessions running at its SAVE EVERYTHING checkpoint; confirm currently rather than trust that report. Before starting any -c6 agents, verify the new Claude account can actually create sessions; wait for startup checks and confirm they RECEIVED their briefs (previous sessions sometimes started idle with no prompt). Do not promise background work that isn't truly scheduled and running.\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\n6. MY NON-NEGOTIABLE SCREEN / GOOGLE FLOW SPLIT\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\n01–03 = GOOGLE FLOW OPENING VIDEO made by me. Girl secretly carries Benny hidden in purple towel, loads washer, shuts door, walks away. This includes the unusual/crazy-eyed pink character introduction.\n04–08 = THE ONLY FIVE REAL PLAYABLE 3D ANDROID GAME SECTIONS to visually reconstruct:\n04 THROUGH THE FIVE ARROWS;\n05 FLOW INTO THE CURRENT;\n06 CREST THE RINSE ARCH;\n07 DIVE THE WASHER TUBE;\n08 FINAL SPIN CHAMBER.\n09–11 = GOOGLE FLOW ENDING VIDEO made by me. Benny returns and hides before girl notices; girl picks up the towel, unaware.\n\nDo not spend work/credits perfecting temporary 3D stand-ins in 01–03 / 09–11. Prese