n my approval before production integration or paid work.\n251\tSTEP 8: Save everything to GitHub at safe checkpoints. Ensure next-account transfer remains easy, with credential limitations and handoff documented.\n252\t\n253\t-------------------------------------------------------------------\n254\t19. WHAT CAN AND CANNOT BE TRANSFERRED AUTOMATICALLY\n255\t-------------------------------------------------------------------\n256\tCAN TRANSFER THROUGH GITHUB: all committed game source, approved reference files, 3D assets, splats/meshes/GLBs/textures, saved images/videos/APKs tracked with Git LFS, ten agent definition files, prompts and notes, tested branches, safe configuration templates, QA scripts and recorded progress.\n257\tCANNOT BE ASSUMED TO TRANSFER: Claude account usage credits, login state, account-specific chats, running agent processes/sessions, secret API keys, GitHub permissions, network allowlists, personal cloud environment, optional connector authorization, desktop install state and any unpushed files. Ask for secure user action when technically necessary. Account credits at World Labs/fal.ai remain with THOSE service accounts, not GitHub or Claude.\n258\t\n259\t-------------------------------------------------------------------\n260\t20. THE REPORT I EXPECT FROM YOU\n261\t-------------------------------------------------------------------\n262\tAfter verifying, provide:\n263\t- LEAD repo/branch/new continuation branch + exact full SHAs; remote=local proof.\n264\t- List of seven specialist source -c5 branches and any new -c6 branches, full SHAs, latest REAL milestone and state (active/paused/blocked).\n265\t- Combined preview branch status and the unresolved all-switches conflict (including Screen08 ~29.5% issue) — DO NOT imply production ready.\n266\t- All 13 reference checksums + all 10 specialist definitions.\n267\t- Git LFS item count/size/fsck and missing/absent reports.\n268\t- Current toolchain, MCP servers and plugin status; what needed manual reconnection vs restored automatically.\n269\t- Which World Labs account is connected (Screen08 original or Screen05 pilot); credits free-read result or unavailable status; fal.ai original paid account verified by old request or unavailable.\n270\t- Playable Screen 04–08 visual status and biggest remaining defects, especially while swimming.\n271\t- Game tests, Flow tests, latest APK and whether tested on a REAL PHONE.\n272\t- Exact next action, proposed count of active parallel agents, and reasonable usage protection.\n273\t- Anything that cannot be recovered, with no fabricated assurances.\n274\t\n275\tUse phrase \"RAINBOW 3D BACKUP VERIFIED\" ONLY after actual local/remote and asset integrity checks pass. A connected repo alone is not enough. Do not claim all agents are running unless sessions really exist and have accepted their briefs.\n276\t\n277\t-------------------------------------------------------------------\n278\t21. HARD RULES — DO NOT BREAK THESE\n279\t-------------------------------------------------------------------\n280\tNO new Rainbow game. NO new characters. NO redesign of approved scenery. NO deleting originals. NO automatic merges, force-push, branch overwrites or production switch activation. NO paid Marble / World Labs / fal / Meshy / Rodin / video generations without explicit approval. NO printing API keys or placing them in GitHub. NO telling me an optional MCP failure means all tools are broken. NO spending time making cinematic girl scenes as playable 3D. NO seven-at-once agent burn; at most TWO specialists simultaneously. NO claiming a static 98% pixel score means the whole moving game looks 98% identical. NO marking a screen approved without me.\n281\t\n282\tMy priority is to finish all FIVE approved playable game screens visually, including scenery, backgrounds, colored glossy water, lighting, rings, props, Benny and coins. Keep the successful previous work. Continue from the NEWEST GitHub checkpoints. Ask me only about true permissions, paid spending, merge approvals and visual verdicts; do as much restoration as possible automatically and safely. Begin with a READ-ONLY audit, then continue the existing game.\n283\t\n284\tEND OF COMPLETE ACCOUNT-TRANSFER PROMPT.\n285\t\n</system-reminder>"}], "renderedRole": "user", "sessionId": "cd1e5cfb-443e-5b5a-b9b8-262d44ab3b8a", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T21:49:30.917Z", "type": "attachment", "userType": "external", "uuid": "2cbcb38f-6f8c-446f-8b14-fc55a41c3706", "version": "2.1.326"}
